  "description": "Compare app calendar periods using London time: start midnight, end midnight after the final day (excluded). Top totals include every stored reading in the selected range; missing readings are not filled. Gas is stored as m³ and converted using m³ × 1.02264 × calorific value ÷ 3.6. The default 40 MJ/m³ is an estimate, not a verified supplier value. The app/bill may differ. No standing charge is included in cost estimates."
